; parse_date_mask_routine formats each parsed date back and compares it
; with the input.  That round trip is what rejects text strptime leaves
; unconsumed after a complete date; out-of-range months and days are
; rejected by strptime itself, and impossible days such as Feb 30 by
; Boost.Date (see cov-times-invalid-date.test).  These blocks pin the
; dates the round trip accepts, a leading zero that the input omits
; included; date-round-trip-trailing-text-errors.test pins the trailing
; text it rejects.

2024/01/05 Payee
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    Assets:Cash

test eval [2024/01/05] --now 2030/06/15
2024/01/05
end test

test eval [2024/1/5] --now 2030/06/15
2024/01/05
end test
